      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Marina enthusiasts can dock at Anglers Marina, Piney Narrows Yacht Haven, The Kent Narrows Boatel, Safe Harbor Narrows Point, Cedar Point, or Wells Cove.",
